cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use Soranoha in research, please cite the release you used. A release
  is identified by its head, and each release is archived with its own version
  DOI; see docs/citation.md for the citation forms and worked examples.
title: "Soranoha Aozora TEI Corpus"
abstract: >-
  Soranoha converts Aozora Bunko's public-domain Japanese texts to TEI P5,
  with plaintext and Markdown projections and a validation report for every
  work, and publishes them as a signed, append-only chain of content-addressed
  releases. Corpus artifacts are dedicated to the public domain under CC0-1.0;
  the conversion and publication tooling is licensed Apache-2.0.
type: dataset
license: CC0-1.0
authors:
  - family-names: "Hodošček"
    given-names: "Bor"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-2246-8774"
    affiliation: "Osaka University"
url: "https://soranoha.org"
keywords:
  - Aozora Bunko
  - TEI
  - Japanese literature
  - digital humanities
  - corpus
  - collections as data
